## Products
- [Plaid products - Financial APIs & connections for fintech](https://plaid.com/products/index.html.md): Plaid enables fintech solutions for all companies--from payments and fraud to connectivity and credit. Learn more about Plaid products & start building.
- [App Directory - Insights on customer app connections](https://plaid.com/products/app-directory/index.html.md): Plaid's App Directory provides a streamlined dashboard with insights on up-to-date customer connections to help manage risk and compliance. Learn more. 
- [Assets - Asset verification software - check & verify assets](https://plaid.com/products/assets/index.html.md): Reduce reliance on manual document uploads and reviews. Verify assets and account ownership directly from the source with Plaid assets. Learn more.
- [Auth - Instant bank account verification API](https://plaid.com/products/auth/index.html.md): Plaid's Auth API product allows companies to instantly authenticate bank accounts for payments and set up ACH transfers from any bank.
- [Balance API - verify bank account balance](https://plaid.com/products/balance/index.html.md): Plaid's Balance API allows companies to verify real-time account balances. Protect against overdraft and NSF fees.
- [Beacon - The anti-fraud network for fintech](https://plaid.com/products/beacon/index.html.md): Beacon leverages the power of the Plaid network to stop the proliferation of identity fraud in its tracks. Protect your users and fight fraud with Beacon.
- [Cash Advance Index - Network-powered risk decisions](https://plaid.com/products/cash-advance-index/index.html.md): Make better cash advance decisions with network insights. Assess repayment risk, optimize amounts, and adjust collection strategy across the lifecycle.
- [Database Auth - Verify account & routing number](https://plaid.com/products/database-auth/index.html.md): Verify bank accounts using account & routing numbers with Database Auth. Built for manual verification flows, Database Auth is API-based bank verification.
- [Enrich - Data enrichment and transaction categorization API](https://plaid.com/products/enrich/index.html.md): Enrich brings clarity to the transaction data generated from your banking products, or from non-Plaid sources. Enhancements include merchant, category, and location insights.
- [Plaid guaranteed payments for ACH settlement & risk](https://plaid.com/products/guaranteed-payments/index.html.md): Plaid Guaranteed Payments guarantees settlement against ACH returns enabling companies to scale their payments programs without risk.
- [Identity Verification - Global IDV to Ensure KYC Compliance](https://plaid.com/products/identity-verification/index.html.md): Verify your users’ identities, around the world. Ensure know your customer (KYC) and customer due diligence (CDD) compliance while improving conversion rates.
- [Identity – API to match & verify bank account ownership](https://plaid.com/products/identity/index.html.md): Instantly verify bank account ownership and match user ID data with Identity. Plaid's identity matching API helps teams reduce fraud and speed up onboarding.
- [Investments Move: Fast, secure brokerage transfers](https://plaid.com/products/investments-move/index.html.md): Plaid’s Investments Move helps brokerages automate asset transfers, reduce rejections, and improve conversion with broker-sourced data.
- [Investment API - retrieve investment data](https://plaid.com/products/investments/index.html.md): Plaid's Investments API allows companies to build a holistic view of a user's investment accounts, including account balances, holdings, and transactions.
- [Liabilities API - Verify debt and loan data](https://plaid.com/products/liabilities/index.html.md): Access detailed loan data all with a simple endpoint. Liabilities helps you retrieve details on major debts, like credit cards, and mortgages.
- [Monitor - AML customer screening solution](https://plaid.com/products/monitor/index.html.md): Automate AML customer screening with global watchlists, PEP screening, ongoing monitoring, and case management to reduce false positives.
- [Permissions Manager - permissions management API](https://plaid.com/products/permissions-manager/index.html.md): Help your users manage all of their connections to Plaid-powered apps with a custom consumer permissions portal. Build better with Plaid. 
- [Protect - Real-time fraud detection & risk scoring](https://plaid.com/products/protect/index.html.md): Prevent fraud, not growth. Get a real-time fraud score at any step of the user journey with Plaid Protect. Learn how to reduce fraud without friction.
- [Signal - ACH Risk Assessment & Scoring API](https://plaid.com/products/signal/index.html.md): Signal - a machine learning risk engine - assesses and predicts the risk of an ACH return. Learn more about Signal, ACH return risk and fraud management.
- [Transactions API - Bank account history & credit card data](https://plaid.com/products/transactions/index.html.md): Transactions is a simple API that helps companies get comprehensive transaction data from thousands of banks and financial institutions. Learn more.
- [Transfer - A complete bank transfer API - ACH, RTP & FedNow](https://plaid.com/products/transfer/index.html.md): Transfer helps users move money quickly and securely on the rail of their choice. Simplify bank transfers and improve performance with a single powerful API.

